  </div>

  <!-- SLIDE 10: DEFUZZIFIKASI -->
  <div class="slide-box">
    <div class="slide-header">
      <span class="slide-title">3. DEFUZZIFIKASI — Metode Rata-Rata Terbobot (Average)</span>
    </div>

    <p><b>Metode Average (rata-rata):</b></p>
    <div style="font-size:12pt; text-align:center; padding:10px;" class="formula-block">
      <b>Z* = Σ(α<sub>i</sub> × z<sub>i</sub>) / Σ(α<sub>i</sub>)</b>
    </div>

    <table>
      <tr>
        <th>Aturan</th>
        <th>α-predikat (α<sub>i</sub>)</th>
        <th>Nilai z (z<sub>i</sub>)</th>
        <th>Bobot (α<sub>i</sub> × z<sub>i</sub>)</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><b>[R1]</b></td>
        <td>0,68</td>
        <td>3.960</td>
        <td>0,68 × 3.960 = <b>2.692,80</b></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><b>[R2]</b></td>
        <td>0,32</td>
        <td>5.040</td>
        <td>0,32 × 5.040 = <b>1.612,80</b></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><b>[R3]</b></td>
        <td>0,1714</td>
        <td>3.514,29</td>
        <td>0,1714 × 3.514,29 = <b>602,45</b></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><b>[R4]</b></td>
        <td>0,1714</td>
        <td>3.514,29</td>
        <td>0,1714 × 3.514,29 = <b>602,45</b></td>
      </tr>
      <tr style="background:#fef08a; font-weight:bold;">
        <td>TOTAL (Σ)</td>
        <td>1,3428</td>
        <td>—</td>
        <td>5.510,50</td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="formula-block" style="text-align:center; font-size:11.5pt; margin:14px 0;">
      Z* = (2.692,80 + 1.612,80 + 602,45 + 602,45) / (0,68 + 0,32 + 0,1714 + 0,1714)<br><br>
      Z* = 5.510,50 / 1,3428 = <b>4.103,74</b> ≈ <span style="font-size:14pt; color:#15803d; font-weight:bold;">4.104 bungkus</span>
    </div>

    <div class="result-banner">
      KESIMPULAN:<br>
      Jika banyaknya permintaan bernilai 2.600 bungkus dan persediaan bernilai 440 bungkus,<br>
      maka jumlah produksi optimal opak gambir adalah <u>4.104 bungkus</u>.
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</div>
